This software signs and broadcasts blockchain transactions on the user's
behalf — including CROSS-native transfers on CROSS Chain (612055) and
BNB-native transfers on BSC (56) — to a payment escrow contract that binds
each tx to an off-chain `cross.shop` orderId. Use at your own risk. The
authors accept no liability for any loss of funds, mis-paid orders,
undelivered in-game items, or other financial / TOS damage arising from use
of this software. Always test the read commands first (`games`, `products`,
`quote`) and review the bundled scripts before granting it your private key
or game UUID. Driving a third-party game shop programmatically may violate
the shop's or game's TOS — operate only on your own account and your own
wallet.
